! Forks that await the operator's word

''Both forks the operator owed are RULED and LANDED (see #/landed): `:814` → Option 1 (`6b0910fbc`), ④ → keep-separate (`dacae83b8`). No open operator forks remain — only the deferred+pinned items in #/deferred and the small follow-ons in #/hazards.''

